        "text": "SMTP (Port 25)\nWe will use the vulnerable Metasploitable host for this example. But before\nproceeding, let\u2019s try to understand what we\u2019re looking for at this stage:\nI\nI Check whether the server supports the VRFY command so we can enu-\nmerate users.\nI\nI Check if there is a public exploit for the target server. (We will discuss this\npoint in Chapter 7, \u201cExploitation Phase.\u201d)\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Nmap Basic Enumeration\n\u2022 Nmap Advanced Enumeration\n\u2022 Enumerating Users\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
